Amma Meri Gardan Se Hathou Ku Hatalo<br>
Chalne Do Churi Mujh Par Nazrou Ku Hatalo<br>
<br>
1.Zinda Hu Abhi Chalti Hai Saanse Meri Amma<br>
Ab Tak Toh Khuli Hai Meri Aanken Meri Amma<br>
Aaye Sabare Maa Sar Me Abhi Khahk Na Daalo<br>
Amma Meri Gardan Se Hathou Ku Hatalo<br>
<br>
2.Chani Hai Badan Teerou Se Gurbat Ki Ghadi Hai<br>
Aaye Amma Meri Mout Mere Sar Pa Khadi Hai<br>
Ek Bar Zara Mujh Ku Seene Se Laagalo<br>
Amma Meri Gardan Se Hathou Ku Hatalo<br>
<br>
3.Maare Gaye Amma Mere Sab Naser-o-Yawar<br>
Be Gur-o-Kafan Reth Pe Hai Laash-e-Asghar<br>
Is Khoon Bhare Manzar Ku Aankhou Me Basalo<br>
Amma Meri Gardan Se Hathou Ku Hatalo<br>
<br>
4.Abbas Alamdar Ka Ehsan Hai Mujh Par<br>
Pyasa Hai Mera Bhai Abhi Tak Laabe Kausar<br>
Baazu Mere Gaazi Ke Rethi Se Uthalo<br>
Amma Meri Gardan Se Hathou Ku Hatalo<br>
<br>
5.Laasa Ali Akber Ka Bhi Maine Hi Uthaya<br>
Khoon Ashgar-e-Besheer Ka Chehre Pa Lagaya<br>
Tum Khoon Mera Apne Chehre Pe Lagalo<br>
Amma Meri Gardan Se Hathou Ku Hatalo<br>
<br>
6.Turbat Se Nikalenge Laayi Laasa-e-Asghar<br>
Sar Uska Ka Bhi Naize Pe Chadhaenge Sitamgar<br>
Laasa Mere Asghar Ka Daman Me Chupalo<br>
Amma Meri Gardan Se Hathou Ku Hatalo<br>
<br>
7.Har Simt Mere Fouj-e-Sitamgar Khadi Hai<br>
Zainab Daare Khaima Pe Wahan Ghash Me Padhi Hai<br>
Gar Hosake Aaye Amma Zainab Ku Sambhalo<br>
Amma Meri Gardan Se Hathou Ku Hatalo<br>
<br>
8.Mehdi Yeh Laabe Shah Pa Tha Aakhri Nouha<br>
Tha Noor Ali Alam-e-Imkan Me Girya<br>
Sheh Bole Jo Amma Mere Nana Ku Bulalo<br>
Amma Meri Gardan Se Hathou Ku Hatalo
